<title>USA: Dreyfus names Ramos portfolio manager.</title>
<headline>Dreyfus names Ramos portfolio manager.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mutual fund company Dreyfus Corp said Tuesday it had named Douglas Ramos senior equity portfolio manager, senior vice president and head of Growth &amp; Income Equities.</p>
<p>Ramos, who joins Dreyfus from Loomis, Sayles &amp; Co LP in Pasadena, California, will manage four portfolios, Dreyfus Balanced Fund Inc, Dreyfus Growth and Income Fund Inc, Dreyfus Premier Growth and Income Fund and Dreyfus Variable Investment Fund-Growth and Income Portfolio.</p>
</text>
